    "body": "If we wanna go this route it could potentially useful to do multi stage builds or alternatively just build the base image with all the environments and then push that image to docker-hub or the azure pipeline image repo. \r\n\r\nWe could then reuse that image, could make things a lot faster since its reusing cached images. \r\nEspecially since they gonna pretty big with all the environments needed to run the tests.",
