    "body": "`The docker image does not rebuild if dependencies change` \r\n\r\nEach command here will run and create a layer / image. Everytime the docker image rebuild it will check the hash and either use the cache or re run the command. So in this case it will hash the contents of the `Cargo.toml` and use that as the hash. So if the contents change it will rerun this command and all below it.\r\n",
