    "body": "Correct. I have intentionally made the `integration_test` script skip `docker build` if the image already exists because of the time required to send the build context to the docker daemon when `target/` is built. It's usually around 1GB, so it can take a while.\r\n\r\nIt looks like adding `.dockerignore` to the project root with `target/` solves it. 😄\r\nPushed changes. ",
